        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PR-BGH100CRVSS4, Back-to-Back Bighorn Curved Stainless Door Pulls</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Curved Stainless Steel Door Pull comes packaged as a back-to-back pair of pulls. Since it is made out of stainless steel, it is available in your choice of satin stainless or polished stainless steel finishes. Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. These Back-to-Back Bighorn Curved Stainless Door Pulls can be mounted to curve away from each other or towards each other. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with Back-to-Back mounting (2 door pulls bolted to each other - 1 door pull for each side of a door). Includes lock down threaded rosettes to securely tighten the door pulls to the door. Also available: Individual <a href=\"/products/curved-stainless-steel-door-pull-first-impressions-bgh100crvss4\"><b>First Impressions Model BGH100CRVSS4</b></a> for one side of a door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions PR-BGH100CRVSS4 Curved Stainless Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finishes: <b>Polished Stainless Steel</b> or <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-BGH100CRVSS4-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262228\"><b>First Impressions PR-BGH100CRVSS4 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>PR-BGH100012CRVSS4</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PR-BGH100024CRVSS4</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PR-BGH100036CRVSS4</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: These curved stainless steel door pulls are handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back to Back mounting</b>.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Curved Stainless Steel Door Pulls",
                "description": "The Curved Stainless Steel Door Pull comes packaged as a back-to-back pair of pulls. Since it is made out of stainless steel, it is available in your choice of satin stainless or polished stainless steel finishes. Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. These Back-to-Back Bighorn Curved Stainless Door Pulls can be mounted to curve away from each other or towards each other. \r\n",
